# Normalize line endings in the repository so a Windows and a Linux checkout agree.
# The budget checkers are byte-sensitive about the payloads they measure, not about their own
# source, but CI runs on ubuntu while calibration runs happen on Windows — pinning this removes a
# whole class of "only reproduces on one OS" difference.
* text=auto

# PowerShell checkers run under pwsh on both platforms; keep them LF so the shebang-less scripts
# and here-strings are byte-identical everywhere.
*.ps1 text eol=lf
